        </div><p class="preview-note">Booking preview · Your details stay in this page.</p></aside>
      </div>
      <footer><span class="footer-brand">tidy. &nbsp; A home for the little details.</span><span>Made for your everyday.</span></footer>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script>
